    referenceAnswer: "Directions\n\nThe students union of your university has assigned you to inform the international students about an upcoming singing contest. Write a notice in about 100 words.\n\nWrite about 100 words on the ANSWER SHEET.\n\nDo not use your own name in the notice.(10 points)\n\n查看答案与解析\n\n 收藏\n\n范文\n\nNotice\n\nTo all international students,\n\nOn behalf of the Student Union, we are pleased to announce an upcoming singing contest to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People’s Republic of China. The details are as follows.\n\nAll international students, from freshmen to seniors, are welcome to participate. Contestants may perform songs in either Chinese or other languages. If you wish to take part, please register at the Student Union office. Please note that registration is free of charge.\n\nWe look forward to your enthusiastic participation.\n\nBest wishes,\nThe Student Union\n\n解析\n\n一、格式与结构分析\n\n标题：明确使用“Notice”作为标题，符合书面通知的规范。\n\n称呼：直接面向“all international students”，定位清晰。\n\n正文结构：\n开头说明活动背景及目的；\n\n主体分点介绍参赛对象、曲目要求、报名方式及费用；\n\n结尾表达期待与祝福。\n\n落款：以“The Student Union”替代个人署名，符合题目要求。\n\n二、内容要点\n\n活动目的：庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年。\n\n参赛对象：全体国际学生（本科各年级）。\n\n曲目要求：中英文歌曲均可。\n\n报名方式：学生会办公室现场报名，无需费用。\n\n语言风格：正式得体，兼顾亲和力。\n\n三、语言亮点\n\n使用“on behalf of”“pleased to announce”等正式表达。\n\n被动语态（“are allowed to sign up”）增强客观性。\n\n条件句（“if you are willing to&mldr;”）体现礼貌邀请。\n\n四、改进建议\n\n可补充具体时间、地点使信息更完整。\n\n“the foundation of PRC”改为“the founding of the People’s Republic of China”更规范。\n\n分段可更明确，如用项目符号列举要点。\n\n总结\n本文格式规范、内容完整，符合通知类文体要求，通过简洁语言有效传递关键信息，稍作细节调整即可更趋完善。",
